    },
    {
      "id": "05df6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 1,
      "content": "See the University Catalog for the full listing of degree requirements for this major. See the Admissions website for transfer admission requirements/information. See the International Education &amp; Global Engagement website for international transfer academic qualifications. See the Academic Advising Programs website for information on California Promise and Associate Degree for Transfer. See the University Catalog for Credit by Exam information (AP, IB, CLEP).",
      "contentHtml": "<ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">See the </span><a href=\"https://catalog.csuchico.edu/archive/2025-2026/colleges-departments/college-behavioral-social-sciences/anthropology/anthropology-ba/#programrequirementstext\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">University Catalog</a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> for the full listing of degree requirements for this major.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">See the </span><a href=\"https://www.csuchico.edu/admissions/transfer/index.shtml\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Admissions </a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">website for transfer admission requirements/information.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">See the </span><a href=\"https://www.csuchico.edu/international/qualifications/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">International Education &amp; Global Engagement </a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">website for international transfer academic qualifications.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">See the </span><a href=\"https://www.csuchico.edu/aap/programs/index.shtml\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Academic Advising Programs</a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> website for information on California Promise and Associate Degree for Transfer.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">See the </span><a href=\"https://catalog.csuchico.edu/archive/2025-2026/academic-standards-policies/course-credit-policies/#creditbyexternalexamtext\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">University Catalog</a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> for Credit by Exam information (AP, IB, CLEP).</span></li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "id": "fcde6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralTitle",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 2,
      "content": "Associate Degree for Transfer Match",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fede6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 3,
      "content": "The BA in Anthropology is an approved match to: Anthropology (AA-T) Global Studies (AA-T) Law, Public Policy, and Society (AA-T)",
      "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The BA in Anthropology is an approved match to:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Anthropology (AA-T)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Global Studies (AA-T)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Law, Public Policy, and Society (AA-T)</span></li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "id": "00df6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralTitle",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 4,
      "content": "fields of anthropology",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "08df6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 5,
      "content": "Students select one course from any two of the following subfields of Anthropology: Biological Anthropology Archaeology Cultural Anthropology Museum Studies The only subfield with lower division courses is the Cultural Anthropology subfield. There are also upper division courses available in the Cultural Anthropology subfield. All other requirements for this major are at the upper division level. See the University Catalog for the full listing of degree requirements.",
      "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Students select one course from any two of the following subfields of Anthropology:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Biological Anthropology</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Archaeology</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Cultural Anthropology</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Museum Studies</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The only subfield with lower division courses is the Cultural Anthropology subfield. There are also upper division courses available in the Cultural Anthropology subfield. All other requirements for this major are at the upper division level. See the </span><a href=\"https://catalog.csuchico.edu/archive/2025-2026/colleges-departments/college-behavioral-social-sciences/anthropology/anthropology-ba/#programrequirementstext\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">University Catalog</a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> for the full listing of degree requirements.</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "a39a8073-eaeb-4002-8b9c-01975bc57bde",
      "type": "GeneralTitle",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 6,
      "content": "Important Note",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0520010d-d155-413f-84f8-019755ce93ba",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 7,
      "content": "This agreement is not a static document. Articulations may be updated or added at any time , and the information provided is subject to change without notice. This agreement does not include upper-division major requirements, course prerequisites, general education coursework, or university-specific graduation requirements necessary for degree completion. Department agreements should be referenced alongside major agreements to ensure a clearer understanding of course articulation and program planning.",
      "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">This agreement is not a static document. </span><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Articulations may be updated or added at any time</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">, and the information provided is subject to change without notice.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">This agreement does not include upper-division major requirements, course prerequisites, general education coursework, or university-specific graduation requirements necessary for degree completion.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Department agreements should be referenced alongside major agreements to ensure a clearer understanding of course articulation and program planning.</span></p>"
